<title>UK: Headlam up after positive press comment.</title>
<headline>Headlam up after positive press comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in carpet distributor Headlam Group Plc rose early on Monday after positive comment on the stock in the Sunday Times.</p>
<p>Headlam shares were quoted up 7p at 325-1/2 by 0711 GMT in volume of just 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>The paper said Headlam's acquisition of rival MCD, where margins were half those of Headlam, created opportunities for big efficiency gains.</p>
<p>It said Headlam believed it could maintain its record of 20 percent annual earnings growth and that the stock was an &quot;attractive buy&quot;.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
